What is Lawn Care Service?
Lawn care service encompasses professional maintenance and enhancement of turfgrass areas for residential, commercial, and public properties. The industry combines routine operations like mowing, edging, trimming, and debris removal with specialized programs including fertilization, soil conditioning, pH correction, weed control (pre- and post-emergent treatments), integrated pest management, aeration, dethatching, and irrigation adjustments. These services ensure lawns remain healthy, visually appealing, and functional across changing seasons and environmental conditions.

